### MaterialLots — CREATE (expects 201 Created; plant and material must be active)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@plantId = 1
@materialId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-RIO-PET-202610-100",
  "plantId": {{plantId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "weightKg": 0,
  "description": "Lote nuevo de PET para pacas de 50 kg",
  "status": "active"
}

### MaterialLots — CREATE with negative stock (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-NEGATIVO",
  "plantId": {{plantId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}},
  "weightKg": -5
}

### MaterialLots — CREATE duplicate lot code (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-RIO-PET-202610-100",
  "plantId": {{plantId}},
  "materialId": {{materialId}}
}
